#: ../../source/administration-guide/comply/electronic-discovery.rst:111
msgid ""
"The Mattermost database stores date and time stamps in the `Unix Epoch "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unix_time>`__ format. A tool like the "
"`Epoch Converter <https://www.epochconverter.com/>`__ can be useful in "
"converting to and from the required format."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 데이터베이스는 날짜 및 시간 스탬프를 `Unix Epoch "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unix_time>`__ 형식으로 저장합니다. 필요한 "
"형식으로 변환하거나 되돌릴 때는 `Epoch Converter "
"<https://www.epochconverter.com/>`__ 같은 도구가 유용합니다."

